{
  "dn24:0.1": "Long Discourses 24 ",
  "dn24:0.2": "About Pāṭikaputta ",
  "dn24:1.0": "1. The Story of Sunakkhatta ",
  "dn24:1.1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "dn24:1.1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Mallas, near the Mallian town named Anupiya. ",
  "dn24:1.1.3": "Then the Buddha robed up in the morning and, taking his bowl and robe, entered Anupiya for alms. ",
  "dn24:1.1.4": "Then it occurred to him, ",
  "dn24:1.1.5": "“It’s too early to wander for alms in Anupiya. ",
  "dn24:1.1.6": "Why don’t I go to visit the wanderer of the Bhaggava clan in his monastery?” ",
  "dn24:1.2.1": "So that’s what he did. ",
  "dn24:1.2.2": "Then the wanderer of the Bhaggava clan said to the Buddha, ",
  "dn24:1.2.3": "“Let the Blessed One come, sir! ",
  "dn24:1.2.4": "Welcome to the Blessed One, sir! ",
  "dn24:1.2.5": "It’s been a long time since you took the opportunity to come here. ",
  "dn24:1.2.6": "Please, sir, sit down, here, a seat is ready.” ",
  "dn24:1.2.7": "The Buddha sat down on the seat spread out, ",
  "dn24:1.2.8": "while the wanderer of the Bhaggava clan took a low seat, sat to one side, ",
  "dn24:1.2.9": "and said to the Buddha, ",
  "dn24:1.2.10": "“Sir, a few days ago Sunakkhatta the Licchavi came to me and said: ",
  "dn24:1.2.11": "‘Now, Bhaggava, I have disavowed the Buddha. ",
  "dn24:1.2.12": "Now I no longer live dedicated to him.’ ",
  "dn24:1.2.13": "Sir, is what Sunakkhatta said true?” ",
  "dn24:1.2.14": "“Indeed it is, Bhaggava. ",
  